&lt;h2&gt;Using Wireflow&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="using-wireflow"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#using-wireflow" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Once you have Wireflow installed which as data plane , now you can enjoy the benefits of a simplified VPN management experience. Use the Wireflow CLI tool to create, manage, and monitor your VPN networks directly from the command line.&lt;/p&gt;
