&lt;h1&gt;Contributions&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;We welcome contributions from the community to help improve Wireflow! Whether it&amp;rsquo;s reporting bugs, suggesting new features, or submitting code changes, your input is valuable to us. Here are some ways you can contribute:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Reporting Issues&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="reporting-issues"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#reporting-issues" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you encounter any bugs or issues while using Wireflow, please report them on our &lt;a href="https://github.com/wireflowio/wireflow/issues"target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;GitHub Issues&lt;svg class="hx:inline hx:rtl:rotate-270 hx:align-baseline" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;
&lt;path d="m9.1716 7.7574h7.0711m0 0v7.0711m0-7.0711-8.4853 8.4853" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/&gt;
&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt; page. Be sure to include as much detail as possible, including steps to reproduce the issue, your environment, and any relevant logs or screenshots.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Suggesting Features&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="suggesting-features"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#suggesting-features" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are always looking for ways to enhance Wireflow. If you have ideas for new features or improvements, please share them on our &lt;a href="https://github.com/wireflowio/wireflow/discussions"target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;GitHub Discussions&lt;svg class="hx:inline hx:rtl:rotate-270 hx:align-baseline" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;
&lt;path d="m9.1716 7.7574h7.0711m0 0v7.0711m0-7.0711-8.4853 8.4853" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/&gt;
&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt; page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Submitting Code Changes&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="submitting-code-changes"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#submitting-code-changes" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you would like to contribute code to Wireflow, first choose a repo, if you want choose wireflow, please follow these steps:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fork the Wireflow repository on GitHub.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clone your forked repository to your local machine.
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
