&lt;h2&gt;Code of Conduct&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="code-of-conduct"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#code-of-conduct" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We expect all contributors to adhere to our &lt;a href="https://github.com/wireflow/wireflow/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md"target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Code of Conduct&lt;svg class="hx:inline hx:rtl:rotate-270 hx:align-baseline" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;
